  "description": "Philip, a servant of the Hester family, faithfully served his master, his wife, and their family. Through a very coincidental turn of events, he comes to feel that the eldest son of the household has suddenly been born. Caught between a sense of alienation and loyalty, Philip spends his days in turmoil; however, when he is chosen as a attendant to the eldest son, Ivan, and begins to serve him closely, his daily life is thrown into chaos. Philip constantly doubts whether Ivan is the 'real' young master. Yet, as he observes Ivan's actions, he increasingly reproaches himself for having doubted him. Just as Philip lets his guard down around Ivan, a certain incident forces him to confront the true nature that Ivan has been hiding...!\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
